# 4️⃣ Count Digits

### 📌 Problem

Count the number of digits in a number.

Example:

```text
12345 → 5 digits
```

### 💻 Code

```java
package p2;

public class CountDigits {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int num = 12345;
        int count = 0;

        while (num > 0) {

            int digit = num % 10;
            num = num / 10;

            count++;
        }

        System.out.println("Count = " + count);
    }
}
```

