# 🔟 Sum of Even Digits

### 📌 Problem

Find the sum of only the even digits.

Example:

```text
583214

Even digits:
8 + 2 + 4 = 14
```

### 💻 Code

```java
package p2;

public class SumOfEvenDigits {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int num = 583214;
        int sum = 0;

        while (num > 0) {

            int digit = num % 10;
            num = num / 10;

            if (digit % 2 == 0) {
                sum = sum + digit;
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Sum = " + sum);
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Sum = 14
```

### 🔍 Dry Run

```text
5 → odd  → skip
8 → even → sum = 8
3 → odd  → skip
2 → even → sum = 10
1 → odd  → skip
4 → even → sum = 14
```

### 🧠 Important Pattern

This combines three concepts:

```java
int digit = num % 10;

if (digit % 2 == 0) {
    sum = sum + digit;
}

num = num / 10;
```

### ⏱️ Complexity

* Time: `O(n)`
* Space: `O(1)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

